sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Customer
  participant R as ROLLER
  participant P as PATCH
  participant API as Loyalty App API
  participant DB as App Database
  participant VIEW as Website or PWA
  participant EXT as External Events (CRUD)

  U->>R: Buy park pass
  opt External create source
    EXT->>R: Create booking event
  end

  R-->>API: Checkout webhook: Send booking, ticket, and waiver data
  API->>DB: Source save: Store booking, ticket, and waiver payloads

  R->>P: Automation sync: Send purchase or booking change
  P->>P: Stamp update: Add stamps from booking quantity
  P->>P: Reward check: Unlock code when stamp threshold is reached
  P-->>API: Loyalty update: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
  API->>DB: Save loyalty snapshot

  alt One or more rewards unlocked
    loop For each unlocked reward
      P->>P: Code generation: Create unique one-time free-pass code
      P->>P: Contact save: Append code to contact code array
      P->>R: Code sync: Register code for checkout validation
    end
    P-->>API: Reward update: POST /webhooks/patch/reward-code
    API->>DB: Save active code list
  end

  U->>VIEW: Open loyalty view
  VIEW->>API: Account request: GET /account
  API->>DB: Account read: Load contact profile, stamps, bookings, waivers, and active code list
  API-->>VIEW: Account response: Return name, contact info, stamp count, upcoming bookings, waiver status, and rewards
  VIEW-->>U: Customer view: Show account details, stamps, upcoming bookings, waiver status or document link, and rewards

  U->>R: Checkout action: Apply free-pass code
  R->>R: Validation rule: Verify code is active and unused
  R->>R: One-time rule: Invalidate code after successful use
  R-->>U: Checkout result: Apply discount when valid

  Note over R,P: ROLLER does not notify PATCH when a code is used.

  loop Scheduled verification automation
    P->>R: Usage check: Query ROLLER Data API checkout data
    R-->>P: Usage result: Return code usage status
    P->>P: Contact update: Mark used codes in contact data
    P-->>API: Status update: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    API->>DB: Used-code save: Add used codes to invalidation list
  end

  alt Booking is edited or canceled later
    EXT->>R: Update or cancel booking event
    R-->>API: Booking webhook: Send updated booking, ticket, and waiver data
    API->>DB: Source update: Store latest booking state
    R->>P: Automation sync: Send booking change
    P->>P: Loyalty correction: Recalculate counter and reward state
    P-->>API: Loyalty correction: POST /webhooks/patch/contact-updated
    API->>DB: State correction: Save corrected loyalty and code state
  end

  alt Webhook processing fails
    API->>DB: Failure log: Store failed webhook only
  end

  U->>VIEW: Refresh loyalty view
  VIEW->>API: Account request: GET /account
  API->>DB: Account read: Load latest account projection
  API-->>VIEW: Account response: Return updated profile, stamps, bookings, waiver, and code status
  VIEW-->>U: Customer view: Show latest account, booking, waiver, and reward state
